  "description": "Seok-hyun is a top celebrity model. He’s got an expensive face and the career to match. He just has one tasty little secret…he loves to dress in drag and go get sweet desserts! The only problem is, rookie model Jiho seems to be aware of Seok-hyun's kinky little hobby. So, Seok-hyun invites Jiho over to clear the air and try to keep his mouth shut. But one thing leads to another and neither seems to have the willpower to resist each other's tasty temptations... \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
